Intended use
------------
This map is intended to use with thiocyanates N#CSC (smiles notation). It was developed for MeSCN, but can be applied for general RSCN molecules.
The provided parameters are converted from the original paper of Choi and Cho
from 2008, but the z-component values are set to zero to refelct the actual
symmetry of the MeSCN molecules.

How to use
----------
This map was only developed for individual labels. No coupling map was developed.

Available parameters
--------------------
At this point the frequency map has no options or parameters.

Warnings that can be raised by this map
---------------------------------------
At this point none.
